// A named idea, and the parts that carry it.
//
// A concept says how pieces fit together and why they are arranged that way.
// The shape documents it points at say what each piece is. Anything specific
// enough to be an implementation note belongs in the shape tree instead, so a
// concept can stay readable when the code underneath it changes.
export abstract anchor Concept as concept:
    // One or two sentences. What is this idea?
    summary:: string

    // The parts that realise it, each pointing at its shape document.
    parts:: list
